# Touch: a finger plays the menus and the board (tapping the Exchange's $
# with the belt tool is refused with its reason), and a tool button.
until 300 Play
frames 10
touch Journey
until 60 First Ford
touch First Ford
until 120 Run one tick (Space)
frames 5
touch $
until 30 That cell is already occupied.
touch Rotate
until 30 Tool: rotate
touch Run one tick (Space)
until 30 Tick: 1 / 120
